COMMENT ON COLUMN unblind_request.treatment IS '揭盲结果处理代码 A/B，仅批准时写入；NULL=尚未批准；拒绝/撤销/到期失败均不残留';
COMMENT ON COLUMN unblind_request.created_at IS '申请时间，Unix 毫秒，UTC';
